 </p>

<p>Map 3 – (10/27/16)</p>

<div alt="APPENDIX F, Bronx CD 1, Map 2, MIH area 3 (Option 1, Option 2) per E. 147th St (N 160250 ZRX) adopted 27 October, 2016" data-embed-button="file_browser" data-entity-embed-display="image:image" data-entity-embed-display-settings="{&quot;image_style&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;image_link&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;image_loading&quot;:{&quot;attribute&quot;:&quot;lazy&quot;}}" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="74cf5fb0-46b0-49eb-83a8-ead43519d37c" data-langcode="en" class="embedded-entity">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/APPENDIX%20F_BX_CD1_Map3_MIHa2.jpg" alt="APPENDIX F, Bronx CD 1, Map 2, MIH area 3 (Option 1, Option 2) per E. 147th St (N 160250 ZRX) adopted 27 October, 2016" typeof="foaf:Image" /></div>
